            "text": "🚀 Dear friends, Astana Hub will host a meeting with a startup scout representing three venture funds from Europe! \n \n🤩 You will be able to listen to project pitches, participate in a networking session, tell the scout about your startup, and possibly find investments from Europe. \n \n🌟 Don’t miss your chance to share your idea with an expert who wants to get to know startups from the international tech park Astana Hub! \n \n📍 December 21 at 15:00, Astana Hub, Media Hall \n \n❗️ To participate, register via the link in the profile description."
